    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving Stage is an open-world driving adventure where players tackle unique driving challenges to unlock new areas, abilities, and upgrades. Progress through beautifully crafted environments, each packed with distinctive obstacles and mechanics that test and expand your driving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from your backyard garage, you'll gradually explore and unlock diverse regions, from realistic street circuits to abandoned urban landscapes and mysterious caves filled with jumps and hazards. Each challenge completed brings not only new areas to explore but also new ways to upgrade and enhance your vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed around discovery, skill progression, and environmental storytelling, Driving Stage encourages players to delve deeper into the world as they unravel the reasons behind their journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving Stage is an open-world driving adventure where players tackle unique driving challenges to unlock new areas, abilities, and upgrades. Progress through beautifully crafted environments, each packed with distinctive obstacles and mechanics that test and expand your driving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from your backyard garage, you'll gradually explore and unlock diverse regions, from realistic street circuits to abandoned urban landscapes and mysterious caves filled with jumps and hazards. Each challenge completed brings not only new areas to explore but also new ways to upgrade and enhance your vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed around discovery, skill progression, and environmental storytelling, Driving Stage encourages players to delve deeper into the world as they unravel the reasons behind their journey.</p>",
    "short_description": "Driving Stage is an open-world driving game focused on completing driving challenges to unlock new areas and vehicle abilities, blending exploration and skill progression in a journey of discovery.",
